        "created_at": "2012-10-15T06:08:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm working on a superhero RPG as a module for my generic RPG system. Obviously, the bulk of the work is in creating and, to an extent, balancing, the various superpowers. There are many, many kinds of superpowers, so I thought I'd ask around here and elsewhere for ideas for superpowers. What kinds of powers would you be excited to play in a superhero RPG?</p><p>Of course I already have a bunch of obvious ones like super strength and super speed, etc.</p>",
