      {
        "id": 40102,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-16T20:08:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sounds slightly similar to the Nobilis system, where you have points up to five in Aspect, Dominion, and Persona, which apply to different things. Basically your character if the god of One Thing of Your Choice. So, anything...literally - Fire, Time, Trees, Socks, Blood Cells...anything at all and your powers will all focus around your chosen thing. Exactly what you can do depends on how you word various aspects of your charcter during character creation. It's a diceless system - Aspect, Persona, and Dominion are resources you must manage in order to be able to do stuff. It can be quite good fun :).</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:13:48.390Z",
